{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your legacy as an elite mercenary in a living sci-fi war. Take contracts, scavenge, upgrade, and fight rivals in a universe shaped by your choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of an elite mercenary, built to survive in brutal war. Gear up with modular suits and weapons for any fight. Salvage resources mid-mission to upgrade and outlast rivals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy is Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-stakes, team-based PvPvE defines every battle. Face armed factions and rival Vanguard squads. Read the field, choose your moment, and strike first.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom Forged</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt, experiment, and carve your own path. Explore colossal wrecks, poisoned swamps, alien jungles, and hostile worlds shaped by your actions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Your Mark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action matters in a persistent sandbox. Your choices define your legacy. Your ambition writes the fate of New Eden.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1872800?t=1758901607","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1872800?t=1758901607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/669682a721c1c5a483acd909c35707c5830ce091/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758901607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/669682a721c1c5a483acd909c35707c5830ce091/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758901607","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/a85dbf2016f1edf64a2277beae4f3653.avif?t=1758901607\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your legacy as an elite mercenary in a living sci-fi war. Take contracts, scavenge, upgrade, and fight rivals in a universe shaped by your choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of an elite mercenary, built to survive in brutal war. Gear up with modular suits and weapons for any fight. Salvage resources mid-mission to upgrade and outlast rivals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy is Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-stakes, team-based PvPvE defines every battle. Face armed factions and rival Vanguard squads. Read the field, choose your moment, and strike first.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom Forged</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt, experiment, and carve your own path. Explore colossal wrecks, poisoned swamps, alien jungles, and hostile worlds shaped by your actions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Your Mark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action matters in a persistent sandbox. Your choices define your legacy. Your ambition writes the fate of New Eden.</p>","developers":["CCP"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/f941076776902f83cf73cf3c7b1d7ed48eaa6e71/header.jpg?t=1758901607","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum